# Cloudflare Pages redirect - keeps the printed QR codes alive.
#
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS
# The table QR cards point at adel-restaurant.pages.dev. If the site moves to
# GitHub and this project is emptied, those printed cards die. This rule
# forwards every old URL to the new home instead, permanently and for free.
#
# HOW TO USE IT
# 1. Replace YOUR-GITHUB-USERNAME below with your actual GitHub username.
# 2. Upload ONLY this file to the Cloudflare Pages project, and remove
#    index.html, menu.html, menu-data.js and logo.png from that project.
#    The redirect has to be the only thing left, otherwise Cloudflare serves
#    the old files and never reaches this rule.
# 3. Test adel-restaurant.pages.dev in a private window afterwards.
#
# Change 301 to 302 if you ever want to move the target again without
# visitors' browsers caching the old destination.

/*    https://YOUR-GITHUB-USERNAME.github.io/adel-restaurant/:splat    301
